.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p
    See this period at a glance — what you pay, value delivered so far, and estimated savings — then scan invoices in one list.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  %p
    OG bills from value delivered. Anyone can see how value is defined on the
    = succeed "." do
      = link_to "OG Value page", organization_value_path(organization)

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li Splash view for the current billing period: paid / likely OG cost, this-period value so far, and estimated savings vs delivery.
    %li The Clarity outcomes card uses this period's timeframe. Full PEPM math and invoice detail live on each invoice page.
    %li One invoice table (newest first): Due, Paid, Waived, plus Future rows for unlocked current/next periods. Future rows link to a likely-invoice preview. Columns include teammates, value PEPM, cost PEPM, and total.
    %li Cadence is visible to billing managers; only an impersonating admin can change it (default is quarterly).
    %li Until the calculation date (one week before due), amounts are “likely”; on that day we lock PEPM and open an invoice.
    %li Charges round down to the nearest $0.50 — below $0.50 per teammate, you pay nothing. Invoice totals are capped at value delivered.
    %li If value already existed before billing, a one-time control can create historical open invoices for prior-setpoint comparisons.
